    "body": "Reproducer: https://github.com/mkinney/Camcraft/tree/issue/2870-five-axis/examples/catalog/multiaxis/five-axis\n\nThe held commit is e8dd91ed3.\nFrom the case directory, run `camcraft-cli script build.camscript`.\nThe script generates three operations and passes verification.\nThe Fanuc post then refuses the first tilted feed because the initial A angle is unknown.\nIssue #2870 is blocked by this defect.\n",
